  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultants externs pour le Q@E de la proposition RSSSR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SRHR team is working on a new and substantial activity (EUR 18 million) to support the Benin government in the implementation of the new law on SRHR, notably the enlarged access to safe abortion. For more information see activity 24-0000127.

Given that the aforementioned activity has an ODA budget of more than EUR 5 mln., and considering the sensitive nature of the project, an Q@E is mandatory.

The Q@E  is to be carried out by two independent experts in the field of SRHR, namely:
1) Sarah K Jones (OASIS);
2) Dr. Jean-Paul Dossou.</narrative>
  </description>
